import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
---
<PolicyPage
  title="Privacy"
  intro="What we hold about you, why, and how to have it back or removed."
>
  <h2>What we keep</h2>
  <p>When you place an order we store your name, email address, delivery address if you are having books posted, your phone number — which we ask for on every order, so we can reach you about it — and what you ordered. If you connect Telegram we also store the identifier of that chat, so we can message you about the order.</p>
  <p>We do not use analytics, advertising or tracking of any kind. Nothing on this site follows you anywhere else.</p>

  <h2>Why</h2>
  <p>To confirm your order, take payment, get the books to you, and answer you if you write to us. We have no other use for it and we do not sell or share it for marketing.</p>

  <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Resend</strong> sends our emails, so it handles your email address and the contents of those messages.</li>
    <li><strong>Telegram</strong> carries our messages if you choose to connect it.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the site and the database.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Nobody else.</p>

  <h2>Searching</h2>
  <p>When a search finds nothing we record what was typed, so we know which books to stock. Nothing is stored about who searched — no address, no account, no link to any order — and these records are deleted after 90 days. Searches that find something are not recorded at all.</p>

  <h2>Telling you when a book is back</h2>
  <p>If you ask us to tell you when an out-of-stock title returns, we hold your email address against that book and nothing else. It is deleted the moment that message is sent, so there is nothing to unsubscribe from and nothing kept afterwards.</p>

  <h2>How long</h2>
  <p>Order records are kept for <span class="blank">[how long — six years is usual for UK tax records]</span>. Baskets that are never ordered are cleared automatically after 48 hours.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask for a copy of what we hold, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, by writing to <span class="blank">[the email address to use]</span>. We will answer within a month. If you are not satisfied you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>This shop is run by <span class="blank">[trading name and, if registered, company number]</span> at <span class="blank">[address]</span>.</p>

  <p class="!text-[13.5px] !text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] pt-4">Last updated <span class="blank">[date]</span>.</p>
</PolicyPage>
